abstract: >-
  A self-contained 23-chapter guide to the translation layer from molecular
  electronic structure to logical quantum circuits. Includes six fermionic
  encoding interfaces, physical-sector tapering requirements, product formulas,
  circuit export, an H₂ dissociation reference, and a fixed-bond H₂O angular
  scan. Companion labs provide interactive F# and Python checks.
